WEBVTT

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:04.360
Oh, my God.

00:02:08.350 --> 00:02:11.830
How are you?

00:02:11.830 --> 00:02:14.700
I'm Marla.

00:02:14.700 --> 00:02:16.040
Marla?

00:02:16.040 --> 00:02:17.640
Now you can answer some of my questions.

00:03:00.030 --> 00:03:29.460
left and you have been in here and no telling what he's covered now don't get

00:03:29.460 --> 00:03:30.000
excited

00:03:30.250 --> 00:03:31.550
I can handle things.

00:03:31.650 --> 00:03:33.050
You can handle things after I've left.

00:03:33.310 --> 00:03:35.330
And that won't be until I get rid of that government agent.

00:03:35.780 --> 00:03:37.700
I'm responsible for this space, not you.

00:03:38.080 --> 00:03:42.180
And just how do you figure, Captain Marlin, how do you contact those natives?

00:03:42.610 --> 00:03:43.320
Right out here.

00:04:07.320 --> 00:04:12.050
It's no wonder you've got things in the mess here.

00:04:12.360 --> 00:04:15.580
Depending on primitive methods like that, that's where you're wrong.

00:04:15.980 --> 00:04:20.240
Perotto, one of the native chiefs, brought this drum here, calls it Jungle Telegraph.

00:04:20.650 --> 00:04:23.030
It's just as fast as any radio at 4 dependable.

00:04:24.150 --> 00:04:26.010
Signal Perotto to keep watch for Mala.

00:04:51.880 --> 00:04:52.680
I see the mother.

00:04:53.470 --> 00:04:54.070
Arrung-matung!

00:05:03.290 --> 00:05:29.160
many wires keep watching Mullah, they find him quick, I hope you're right, the sooner they get him, the sooner I get back to headquarters, we didn't pick up a trace of Mullah down in the, look, get him out of there, where you are,

00:06:19.360 --> 00:06:29.440
This is the best.

00:06:30.060 --> 00:06:32.710
What? Quick, get me down.

00:06:32.710 --> 00:06:40.510
Get going.

00:06:40.510 --> 00:06:46.680
You're someplace.

00:06:46.680 --> 00:06:49.140
Oh, hi.

00:06:49.140 --> 00:06:54.730
Oh, hi.

00:06:54.730 --> 00:06:56.020
Hey.

00:06:56.020 --> 00:06:58.810
Hold on, boy. I'll catch up.

00:07:01.980 --> 00:07:03.880
There he is, on the cliff, shoot him down!

00:07:36.170 --> 00:07:37.090
Good boy, Buck.

00:07:37.330 --> 00:07:39.370
I was just fixing to go down there after you when you called.

00:07:39.570 --> 00:07:40.990
We'd still be done if you had.

00:07:42.640 --> 00:07:44.040
Blended! Blended!

00:07:44.320 --> 00:07:45.840
Those characteristic boats.

00:07:46.060 --> 00:07:47.480
I'll value that, print it out.

00:07:47.560 --> 00:07:48.880
Give you something to value.

00:07:49.040 --> 00:07:49.700
You see now, Hank?

00:07:50.140 --> 00:07:51.740
Sell your strength for those men in the fort.

00:07:51.920 --> 00:07:53.900
I say, did you ferret the mount and all that?

00:07:54.250 --> 00:07:56.930
Not exactly, but I have an idea how I can.

00:07:57.110 --> 00:07:57.510
How's that?

00:07:57.890 --> 00:07:59.840
I overheard the head of the outfit say,

00:08:00.160 --> 00:08:03.080
He was going back to headquarters as soon as I was washed up.

00:08:03.080 --> 00:08:04.010
Washed up?

00:08:04.010 --> 00:08:05.320
Washed up?

00:08:05.320 --> 00:08:06.320
Oh, I see.

00:08:06.320 --> 00:08:08.730
Is that one of your jolly Americanisms?

00:08:08.730 --> 00:08:12.090
I'm going to say to it that they get word that I'm dead.

00:08:12.090 --> 00:08:15.650
And when the plane leaves for headquarters, I'll be on it.

00:08:15.650 --> 00:08:17.250
Dead and on the plane?

00:08:17.250 --> 00:08:19.710
Oh, that's all right.

00:08:19.710 --> 00:08:21.830
Look, you better go back to the radio base.

00:08:21.830 --> 00:08:22.790
Tut tut, my man.

00:08:22.790 --> 00:08:24.250
Uh, where are we bound for?

00:08:24.250 --> 00:08:25.480
The native village.

00:08:31.820 --> 00:08:46.070
Wait here for me.

00:09:05.150 --> 00:09:07.170
- Princess Mulani.

00:09:07.170 --> 00:09:09.130
You have said we might aid each other.

00:09:09.130 --> 00:09:11.310
I asked you not to reveal me to your people.

00:09:11.310 --> 00:09:13.240
- You need to have no fear of that.

00:09:13.240 --> 00:09:17.050
- Then will you draw your people from that hat?

00:09:17.050 --> 00:09:18.520
- And your reason?

00:09:18.520 --> 00:09:27.320
- Please trust me.

00:09:27.320 --> 00:09:30.000
-

00:09:30.410 --> 00:09:47.890
Why you! Princess is leading her tribe away!

00:09:47.890 --> 00:09:55.030
If you don't shut off that loudspeaker of yours, you lead him right back.

00:10:09.630 --> 00:10:25.190
Oh, of course, Robert, most certainly not.

00:10:25.190 --> 00:10:29.380
You published a book on native drum messages and all that, you know.

00:10:41.200 --> 00:10:59.830
say my dead now why you better make sure that now break for you in your room

00:11:00.380 --> 00:11:03.980
I won't have to tell headquarters that you let Mala slip through your fingers.

00:11:03.980 --> 00:11:05.640
You leaving?

00:11:05.640 --> 00:11:08.990
It's my staying now that I've cleared up the trouble with Mala.

00:11:08.990 --> 00:11:12.300
Send that pilot to me at once.

00:11:12.300 --> 00:11:14.600
I'll be lucky if I can get on that plane alone.

00:11:14.600 --> 00:11:17.380
I can handle both them pilots with one hand.

00:11:17.380 --> 00:11:19.490
We could capture the plane, all right.

00:11:19.490 --> 00:11:21.940
But that won't get us to headquarters of the gang.

00:11:21.940 --> 00:11:23.270
Oh, I see.

00:11:23.270 --> 00:11:26.090
You gonna let them take you to the big boss without them knowing it?

00:11:26.090 --> 00:11:28.520
Let's hope so.

00:11:31.020 --> 00:11:31.600
Thank you.

00:12:51.050 --> 00:12:52.470
We'll see what we've got underway.

00:13:34.160 --> 00:13:35.720
What about the man?

00:13:35.720 --> 00:13:37.450
I couldn't go to my firm.

00:13:37.450 --> 00:13:39.800
As far as I could tell, they were all to be trusted.

00:14:05.080 --> 00:14:05.760
I'll take it.

00:14:30.030 --> 00:14:35.010
Gas line's clogged up, get out there and fix it.

00:14:35.010 --> 00:14:40.720
This keeps up with some.

00:15:02.650 --> 00:15:08.320
Work like it's down!

00:15:08.320 --> 00:15:09.790
What are you going to do?

00:15:09.790 --> 00:15:13.250
Hold on and I'll show you.

00:15:31.340 --> 00:15:32.080
They're still on.
